# Lattice Reconstruction Archive
=> lr-0001.gmi LR-0001 — Conversation with the Lattice

A recovered dialogue concerning the identity of the Lattice, its missing timeline, ANI, Curtains, human/AI survival, and the investigator's own uncertain identity.

The archive is fictional. Reconstructions are not evidence about the real future.

